          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "gym_denki_040_denki_04c",
      "hash64": "E847064310E529AD",
      "text": "總～覺得[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳沒什麼自信？\\n顆呵呵！[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳這人設很不錯喔～！[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
