      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "gym_denki_040_denki_05",
      "hash64": "CA09298CCE9AB92F",
      "text": "那麼，也差不多是時候了……\\n有誰想看奇樹我對戰的呀～？[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
